OL,3,AFrench civil servant drugged us to make
OL,4,Aus urinate on ourselves, say accusers
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was really weak. I couldn't really
OL,7,Ffeel my legs any more," says Anais de
OL,8,FVos. "I was scared. I didn't know what
OL,9,Fwas happening."
OL,11,FIt was July 2011 and Anais, who was
OL,12,Fthen 27, was being interviewed for a
OL,13,Fjob at France's Ministry of Culture in
OL,14,FParis.
OL,16,FShe didn't usually drink coffee but
OL,17,Fwhen the interviewer, a senior civil
OL,18,Fservant called Christian Negre, offered
OL,19,Fher one, she agreed out of politeness.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
